id: EVT12-14
package: fandhe-workshop-core
test: restore_resume
target: crates/core/src/checkpoint.rs
find:     run.generation = next;
replace:     run.generation = next; if let Some(b) = run.busy.as_mut() { b.done = 0; }
expect-fail: restore_resumes_progress_in_new_generation
expect-fail: p4_restore_resumes_from_saved_done
note: 復帰で処理中の番号を写しの値にしない（再開が保存時点の番号でなく先頭からになる）。EVT12-5（処理中を解く）とは別の誤り
